          "char_start": 2855,
          "char_end_exclusive": 3032,
          "excerpt": "Never \ndrive to the scene of an accident, fire or other disaster just to look. You may block the way for police, \nfirefighters, ambulances, tow trucks and other rescue vehicles.",
          "excerpt_sha256": "1561c15d8765a90827380c518f1749876c1405fb0a7e92f15568fbf664f30709"
